# Admin conventions (`@platform/admin`)

Folder: `admin/`. Dev port **3001**.

## Stack

- Next.js 16 App Router, React 19, Tailwind CSS 4, Lucide icons, ECharts.

## Site & API

- Site: `getAdminSiteConfig()` in `lib/site.ts`.
- **API-connected:** catalog list + CRUD (`components/catalog/*-catalog-form.tsx`, `ProductCatalogForm` with published-attribute picker; re-exported from `catalog-forms.tsx`; shared UI in `catalog-form-primitives.tsx`), orders list/detail (`ApiOrdersPanel`). Slugs are server-generated — not shown in forms.
- Map DTOs in `lib/mappers/`. Other dashboard pages (dashboard home, customers, coupons, reviews, settings, reports, media, roles) are template/demo data — do not assume API submit works.

## Navigation

- Routes: `config/routes.ts`
- Sidebar: `config/navigation.ts` → filtered by `filterNavigationByFeatures()` in `lib/navigation-filter.ts` using `SiteConfig.features` (e.g. hide coupons when `features.coupons` is false).

## Styling

- Semantic tokens in `app/globals.css` (`bg-brand-600`, `text-ink-500`, …).
- No raw hex in TSX except inside `globals.css`.

## Auth

JWT sign-in via `/api/auth/login` BFF (httpOnly cookies). Protected by `admin/proxy.ts`: validates access token via `GET /api/auth/me` and requires `role: admin`. Non-admin users are rejected at sign-in. Logout calls `POST /api/auth/logout`.

## Optional basePath

`admin/next.config.ts` reads `NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_URL` for subdirectory deploys.

## Quality

```bash
npm run check -w @platform/admin
npm run build -w @platform/admin
```

See `docs/ROUTES.md` for page inventory and `docs/CONVENTIONS.md` for patterns.
